Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. It is the rule text; the gates live there and nowhere else. Detail lives in `.context/`.
Scoped files in `.cursor/rules/` (`architecture.mdc`, `coding.mdc`) only point to sections of `AGENTS.md` and `.context/engineering-guide.md`. They add no rules and hold no gates. `.cursor/rules/pstack-models.mdc` always applies the Bill-approved medium pstack budget; it is not a pointer and isn't restated in `AGENTS.md`.
